Specifications
--------------
The model, readers, writers and checks are written from public specifications,
following the behaviour of the Rust crate yorc-rs
(https://github.com/mgbilby/yorc-rs, same copyright holder, MIT):
  - ORCID Message Schema v3.0 (https://github.com/ORCID/orcid-model)
  - ORCID iD structure and check digit, ISO/IEC 7064:2003 MOD 11-2
    (https://support.orcid.org/hc/en-us/articles/360006897674)
  - ORCID API documentation for the Public API and OAuth
    (https://info.orcid.org/documentation/)
  - XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition), W3C Recommendation
No code was copied from other ORCID software. The library uses the Zig
standard library only.

Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------
None of it is in the package (`paths` in build.zig.zon lists build.zig,
build.zig.zon, src/, README.md, CHANGELOG.md, BENCHMARKS.md, LICENSE and
NOTICE); it is used by the tests only.

testdata/record_3.0/, testdata/common_3.0/
  The ORCID message schema v3.0 (record_3.0 XSDs and samples, and
  common_3.0/common-3.0.xsd), copied unmodified from
  https://github.com/ORCID/orcid-model at commit
  9592e2d3bde21a1edf703f26f8bc304448f886fb.
  Copyright © 2012-2018 ORCID, Inc. ORCID MIT-style license:
  testdata/LICENSE-ORCID.

testdata/group-id-3.0/group-id-3.0.xml
  ORCID's group-id-3.0 sample, from the same commit and under the same
  licence.

Test data
---------
testdata/0000-0003-0100-6634.xml is the public ORCID record of
0000-0003-0100-6634 as returned by https://pub.orcid.org/v3.0/. ORCID makes
public record data available under CC0 1.0
(https://info.orcid.org/documentation/integration-guide/orcid-public-data-file/).

testdata/0000-0002-2771-9344.xml is the public ORCID record of
0000-0002-2771-9344 (a fictitious person's record that ORCID uses as an
example), as returned by https://pub.orcid.org/v3.0/0000-0002-2771-9344/record,
unmodified (byte-identical to yorc-rs's tests/data/0000-0002-2771-9344.xml);
CC0 1.0 like the record above. The walkthrough reads it.

testdata/dump/orcid_test_summaries.tgz is a small archive in the layout of
the ORCID Public Data File (byte-identical to yorc-duckdb's
test/data/dump/orcid_test_summaries.tar.gz): the record above, the ORCID
sample record-3.0.xml, a README and a member with a GNU long name.
testdata/dump/orcid_test_two_members.tgz holds the ORCID sample record
record-3.0.xml and a README in the same layout, gzipped as two concatenated
members, for the multi-member gzip tests.

testdata/changes/old.xml is the ORCID sample record record-3.0.xml
(fictitious iD 8888-8888-8888-8880); new.xml is an edited copy of it. Both are
copied from yorc-duckdb's test/data/changes. testdata/group-id-3.0/
group-id-records.xml is the group-id-records page of yorc-duckdb's
test/sql/orcid_api_messages.test.

testdata/xsd_uncovered.txt is the same list as yorc-rs's
tests/xsd_uncovered.txt.

